arbitrary-text-speech = not-established
physical-ASUS-HDA-speech = not-established
secure-boot = not-established
claim = success establishes keyboard-selected first-party speech over native HDA where DAC and output-pin NIDs are discovered at runtime, output policy is verified, and EAPD is enabled and read back when the selected physical pin advertises EAPD capability
claim = success does not establish arbitrary-text TTS multi-hop codec routing physical ASUS output or Secure Boot
